                                "sense_id": "8f030cb3-239e-3503-9a3c-3f8c4d47a33a",
                                "text": "I had always suspected him of being in love with Sylvie, but he was a man of great pudicity; when it was once a case of doing a mild psychotherapy on her he passed her over to someone else in order, I thought, not to prejudice his doctor's control: or was it because he did not wish to feel the jealousy caused by his probings?"
